{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":505121,"name":"Shaun Bowe","username":"Shaun_Bowe","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/shaun_bowe/{size}/120884_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-01T21:50:11.929Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-505121-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-505121-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-505121-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-505121-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen switching between bots in the desktop agent the message pane re-paints strange. Sometimes it shows up blank, sometimes it is just cutoff and only some of the messages are there. Scrolling the mouse wheel once fixes the issue and everything paints correctly\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-505121-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-505121-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot Desktop on Windows\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChange Bots\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSee partially filled or blank message screen\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScroll the mouse wheel of move the scroll in the pane up and down and it is fixed.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-505121-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-505121-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen you switch bots the entire conversation should be there.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-505121-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-505121-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c